---
import PresentationLayout from "@components/PresentationLayout.astro";
---

<PresentationLayout eyebrow="债券" title="可转债的债性与股性" narrow>
  <div class="root">
    {/* 定义：一张公司债 + 一份转股权利 */}
    <div class="leadBox">
      <p class="leadText">
        可转换公司债券 = 一张普通公司债&nbsp;<b>+</b>&nbsp;一份「按约定价格换成该公司股票」的权利
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mainGrid">
      {/* 左：债性 */}
      <div class="attrCard attrDebt">
        <p class="attrTag">债性 · 下有保底</p>
        <p class="attrText">
          不转股时它就是一张普通公司债：按票面利率收息、到期收回本金。价格跌到「债底」附近，通常就很难再跌。
        </p>
      </div>

      {/* 中：收益曲线示意图 */}
      <div class="chartPanel">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 660 520" role="img" aria-label="可转债价格随正股价格变化的收益曲线：正股低于转股价时贴近债底，高于转股价后跟随正股上行">
          {/* 曲线下方的价值区域 */}
          <path d="M62 256 L359 256 L648 65 L648 452 L62 452 Z" fill="rgba(30,64,175,0.07)" />

          {/* 坐标轴 */}
          <line x1="62" y1="452" x2="648" y2="452" stroke="#94a3b8" stroke-width="2" />
          <line x1="62" y1="452" x2="62" y2="26" stroke="#94a3b8" stroke-width="2" />
          <polygon points="652,452 641,447 641,457" fill="#94a3b8" />
          <polygon points="62,22 57,33 67,33" fill="#94a3b8" />
          <text x="648" y="488" text-anchor="end" fill="#64748b" font-size="20">正股价格</text>
          <text x="34" y="237" text-anchor="middle" transform="rotate(-90 34 237)" fill="#64748b" font-size="20">转债价格</text>

          {/* 债底（纯债价值） */}
          <line x1="62" y1="256" x2="648" y2="256" stroke="#1e40af" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-dasharray="9 6" />

          {/* 转股价值 */}
          <line x1="62" y1="452" x2="648" y2="65" stroke="#94a3b8" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-dasharray="9 6" />

          {/* 可转债实际价格曲线：先走平，越过转股价后跟随正股 */}
          <path d="M62 256 L359 256 L648 65" fill="none" stroke="#1f2937" stroke-width="4.5" stroke-linejoin="round" />

          {/* 转股价位置 */}
          <line x1="359" y1="256" x2="359" y2="452" stroke="#94a3b8" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="3 6" />
          <circle cx="359" cy="256" r="7.5" fill="#1e40af" />
          <text x="359" y="486" text-anchor="middle" fill="#64748b" font-size="20">转股价</text>

          {/* 曲线标注 */}
          <text x="82" y="242" fill="#1e40af" font-size="21" font-weight="600">债底 · 纯债价值</text>
          <text x="105" y="335" fill="#94a3b8" font-size="20">转股价值</text>
          <text x="445" y="96" fill="#b91c1c" font-size="21" font-weight="600">跟随正股上行</text>
        </svg>
      </div>

      {/* 右：股性 */}
      <div class="attrCard attrEquity">
        <p class="attrTag">股性 · 上不封顶</p>
        <p class="attrText">
          股价一旦涨过转股价，转股就划算，可转债价格随正股同步走高，理论上没有上限。
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    {/* 附注 */}
    <p class="footnote">
      ※ 这份权利并不免费：可转债票面利率通常明显低于同评级的普通公司债；<br />实际价格还受转股价、强赎、回售、下修等条款影响，通常含一层转股溢价，公司信用风险也依然存在。
    </p>
  </div>
</PresentationLayout>

<style>
  /* ---- page-specific: 08c-convertible-bonds ---- */
  .root {
    height: 100%;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.9rem;
  }

  /* 定义条：单行，居中 */
  .leadBox {
    padding: 0.55rem 1.4rem 0.7rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .leadText {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #1e40af;
    line-height: 1.4;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 0.22em;
    text-decoration-thickness: 1px;
  }

  /* 债性 + 曲线 + 股性 三栏，图居中 */
  .mainGrid {
    flex: 1;
    min-height: 0;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 0.7fr 2fr 0.7fr;
    gap: 1.2rem;
    align-items: stretch;
  }

  .chartPanel {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    min-width: 0;
    min-height: 0;
  }

  .chartPanel svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
  }

  .attrCard {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: flex-start;
    gap: 0.45rem;
    padding: 1rem 1.3rem;
    border: 1px solid;
  }

  .attrDebt {
    align-self: end;
    border-color: rgba(29, 78, 216, 0.28);
  }

  .attrEquity {
    align-self: start;
    border-color: rgba(153, 27, 27, 0.28);
  }

  .attrTag {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .attrDebt .attrTag {
    color: #1e40af;
  }

  .attrEquity .attrTag {
    color: #b91c1c;
  }

  .attrText {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: #475569;
  }

  /* 附注 */
  .footnote {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: #94a3b8;
    text-align: right;
  }
</style>
